{
  "name": "Daily EU TED, France BOAMP & UK Public Tenders Alert to Slack",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily EU TED, France BOAMP & UK Public Tenders Alert\n\n**How to set up (2 min):**\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential: Header Name = `Authorization`, Value = `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Customize `sources` (`EU_TED`, `FR_BOAMP`, `UK_FTS`), `keywords`, `countries`, or `cpvCodes` in the HTTP Request node.\n3. Connect Slack and activate the weekday 08:00 schedule.\n\nActor docs: https://apify.com/clearstack-data/eu-public-tenders-monitor",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "setup-sticky-note",
      "name": "Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "daily-trigger",
      "name": "Every Weekday at 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/clearstack-data~eu-public-tenders-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"sources\":[\"EU_TED\",\"FR_BOAMP\",\"UK_FTS\"],\"keywords\":[\"software\",\"cloud\",\"cybersecurity\"],\"publishedSinceDays\":1,\"onlyOpenTenders\":true,\"maxResultsPerSource\":25}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "fetch-tenders",
      "name": "Fetch New EU/FR/UK Public Tenders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "if (!items.length) return [];\nconst lines = items.slice(0, 15).map(i => {\n  const t = i.json;\n  const val = t.estimatedValue ? ` | ${t.estimatedValue} ${t.currency || ''}` : '';\n  const ddl = t.deadlineDate ? ` | Deadline: ${t.deadlineDate}` : '';\n  return `- [${t.source} / ${t.country || '?'}] *${t.title}* (${t.buyerName || 'Public buyer'}${val}${ddl}) -> ${t.url}`;\n});\nreturn [{ json: { text: `*Daily EU/FR/UK Public Tenders (${items.length} matches)*\\n` + lines.join('\\n') } }];"
      },
      "id": "format-digest",
      "name": "Format Slack Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "channel": "#public-tenders",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}"
      },
      "id": "send-slack",
      "name": "Send to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Weekday at 08:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Fetch New EU/FR/UK Public Tenders",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Fetch New EU/FR/UK Public Tenders": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Slack Digest",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Slack Digest": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
